{"3932790":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Garfield - Escape from Monday","steam_appid":3932790,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wake up Garfield from this nightmarish veggie filled 3D Platformer! The laziest cat is about to work hard in Garfield - Escape from Monday!<\/h2><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.poster.avif?t=1792507651\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.webm?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/cd122b8ee257d82551479b84c5d54a3f.mp4?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Garfield may be right not to trust vegetables…<br>When you’re a lazy cat spending most of his time sleeping, having a nightmare can happen. But a nightmare full of vegetables and sugar-free candies, no way! <br>After Jon fed him spinach lasagnas inspired by Chef Monday’s recipe, Garfield falls into a deep sleep...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.poster.avif?t=1792507651\" width=780 height=322 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.webm?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/e66f5f7ae8b4f4ad50761a0ffefe1a68.mp4?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>To wake up and reactivate his taste buds, the laziest cat in the world will have to explore worlds filled with enemies and eat a gigantic deal of lasagnas!<br>Fortunately Garfield can rely on Jon and his friends Odie, Arlene and Pookie. But also on his turkey, surfer and cowboy suits that will give him amazing skills!<br><br><strong>Move like a cat<\/strong><br>Jump, climb the walls, curl up into a ball… you will always land on your feet!<br><br><strong>Embody Garfield in every form<\/strong><br>Go airborne dressed as a turkey, slide on the water like a surfer and swing with your cowboy lasso!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.poster.avif?t=1792507651\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.webm?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/8cc0e5b20d842cdda88dc5e151874a91.mp4?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>All the Garfield cast is here<\/strong><br>Jon will be here to help you in your quest, along with Odie and Pookie. But beware Garfield's archenemies, Nermal and Squeak!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/2d91a02b02a5cd70809f62484aee5305.poster.avif?t=1792507651\" width=800 height=314 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/2d91a02b02a5cd70809f62484aee5305.webm?t=1792507651\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3932790\/extras\/2d91a02b02a5cd